OL,3,AUS detains man accused in multi-billion
OL,4,AVenezuelan money laundering scheme
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Colombian man wanted for allegedly
OL,7,Flaundering money that had been
OL,8,Fillegally syphoned off a Venezuelan
OL,9,Fgovernment welfare plan has been
OL,10,Fdetained in the United States.
OL,12,FThe US Department of Justice said
OL,13,FAlvaro Pulido, 62, had been arrested
OL,14,Fduring a Homeland Security Task Force
OL,15,Foperation on Sunday, but did not
OL,16,Fprovide further details as to how he
OL,17,Fended up in US custody.
OL,19,FPulido had been in jail in Venezuela
OL,20,Fsince March 2023 accused of diverting
OL,21,Fprofits from the state-run oil company
OL,22,FPDVSA.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
